			"Message": "style(Mist): Fix HTML entity usage in Funding & Acknowledgements header\n\nReplace the LaTeX-style escape sequence `\\&` with the standard HTML ampersand `&` in the `Funding & Acknowledgements` section header of `README.md`.\n\nThis ensures the Markdown renders correctly without literal backslashes and maintains consistency with the project's standard formatting for special characters and section titles.",
